# The language page from the main menu's options (fixtures/sound: English
# texts and voices on the Sound Blaster), on pcmusic, whose track 9 plays
# under the options, and novox, the game's directory less VOX, so that
# each bank of voices comes from the CD. In the advanced options Left and
# Right leave the shadows and the zoom as they are. The fifth entry,
# Choose language, opens the page: Right steps the texts to French,
# German, Spanish, Italian and English, Left back to Italian, and Return
# forward to English, then French, each step drawing the page in its
# language, the music playing on. Right steps the voices to French,
# German, None and English, each bank copied from the CD under the
# transfer's title in French, the CD's track playing on as in the
# Classic, then each language speaks its "Bonjour", "Guten Tag" or "Good
# day", and Return goes back to French. Display text, after the voices,
# goes with them at None and comes back at English. The options and the
# main menu speak French, then a new game's first text, and the lba.cfg
# left names French for both languages.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot advanced
key Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Left Right
sleep 1
key Down
sleep 1
key Left Right
sleep 2
shot unchanged
key Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Right
sleep 2
shot fr
key Right
sleep 2
shot de
key Right
sleep 2
shot sp
key Right
sleep 2
shot it
key Right
sleep 2
shot en
key Left
sleep 2
shot itback
key Return
sleep 2
key Return
sleep 2
shot frreturn
key Down Right
sleep 8
shot voicefr
key Right
sleep 6
shot voicede
key Right
sleep 3
shot voicenone
key Right
sleep 6
shot voiceen
key Return
sleep 4
shot voicefrreturn
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot options2
key Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
key Up Up Return
sleep 4
key a b c
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 15
shot text
